[
  {
    "entryID": 1,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信一腳踏上長凳，衝著櫃檯揚了揚手。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      2
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 2,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「掌櫃的，把你們最好的酒都拿來吧。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      3
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 3,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「信哥，這兒的酒很貴的！？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Surprise);",
    "links": [
      4
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 4,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「擔心什麼，這不是剛拿到報酬嗎。你就放大膽喝，這頓信哥擔了。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      5
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 5,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「信哥好氣魄，那我就不客氣了。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=5);",
    "links": [
      10
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 10,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（酒還沒滿上，隔壁桌先傳來抽噎聲。一名老農坐在那兒，身旁的女兒把臉埋進袖子裡。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      11
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 11,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「還沒喝，便有人助興了……好了好了，別哭了，兩位何故如此哭哭啼啼的？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      12
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 12,
    "actorID": "role_Farmer",
    "text": "[panel=2]「啊！對不住，攪了二位壯士的酒興，只是……」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      13
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 13,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「別只是了，一看就知道有故事的。是什麼事，但說無妨。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      14
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 14,
    "actorID": "role_Farmer",
    "text": "[panel=2]「事情是這樣的……」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      15
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 15,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（故事並不複雜，不外乎就是土匪看上良家女子，脅迫霸佔的老生常談。老農說得斷斷續續，中間停下來喝了兩口水。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      16
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 16,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「[em7]忽然打斷[/em7]，等等。你們爺倆，離了這村，有處去麼？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      17
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 17,
    "actorID": "role_Farmer",
    "text": "[panel=2]「啊？……有、有個遠房的表親，在東邊……可、可是壯士，這跟……」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      18
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 18,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「夠了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      19
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 19,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「欺人太甚。信哥，我看這事……」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Anger);",
    "links": [
      20
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 20,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你轉過頭，長凳上已經沒人了。桌上的酒碗還冒著熱氣，刀不見了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);",
    "links": [
      30
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 30,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（不出多久，呂信回來了，手裡多了一個布袋。他把布袋往桌上一擱，發出沉悶的一聲。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      31
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 31,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「信哥你這是跑去哪了？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=14);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      32
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 32,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「沒去哪。兩位看一下，認不認得這位仁兄。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      33
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 33,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信揭開布袋，赫然是顆人頭。鄰桌的碗筷掉了一地，掌櫃背過身去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      34
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 34,
    "actorID": "role_Farmer",
    "text": "[panel=2]「啊！是他！就是那個逼我女兒的清風寨賊人！多謝壯士！壯士仁義啊！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      35
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 35,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「不必說那些陳詞了。這些錢你們拿去，快快另找個地方安生吧。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      36
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 36,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信解下錢袋放在老農手裡。父女連聲拜謝了許久，才扶著彼此離開。布袋又被他隨手繫上了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      37
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 37,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);SetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndRoll);Continue()@Message(EndRoll);BeginDiceRoll(Auto,InsightCheck,10);",
    "Description": "自動洞悉檢定觸發點：難度10（背景檢定）",
    "links": [
      38
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 38,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "Continue();",
    "Description": "空內容緩衝節點，用於連接檢定結果",
    "links": [
      39,
      43
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 39,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你沒去看那顆人頭。你看的是他——刀已經擦過了，錢袋是連著繫繩一起解下來的，解得很順，像不是第一次解。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice() == true;",
    "links": [
      40
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 40,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「信哥，你是先算好他們走得掉，才動的手。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Insight,10);",
    "links": [
      41
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 41,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「[em7]頓了一下[/em7]，……哈！大家都說我空有武力、少思慮——我怎會想那麼多。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Surprise);",
    "links": [
      42
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 42,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「別多想。人殺了，錢給了，人走了——就這三件事能辦成就行。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      421
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 421,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他把話收得很快，快得像怕人接下去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      50
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 43,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你看了半天，只看見一把擦乾淨的刀，和一個解開的錢袋。至於他是怎麼想的，你看不出來。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      50
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 50,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "Continue();",
    "Description": "選項樞紐（空內容緩衝節點）。⚠ 選項 51／53 在 Unity 端請勾「只播一次」，選過即從選單消失",
    "links": [
      51,
      53,
      55
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 51,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "「信哥，你這一刀下去，他們總算能安生了。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項A：問資訊，不改價值觀，問完回樞紐",
    "links": [
      52
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 52,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「信哥這一刀，替他們了了大事。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": [
      521
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 521,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「能做的謹此罷了，剩下的得看他們自己。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      50
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 53,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "「東邊那個表親，他們走不走得成？你給的那些錢夠不夠用？」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項B：問資訊，不改價值觀，問完回樞紐",
    "links": [
      54
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 54,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「他們往後要去哪？盤纏夠不夠到下一個城？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      541
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 541,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「[em7]往門口看了一眼[/em7]，……夠。我掂過。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=3);",
    "links": [
      542
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 542,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他說完就低頭喝酒，沒再看那個方向。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      50
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 55,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "「這事了了。信哥，還喝嗎？」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項C：推進對話",
    "links": [
      56
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 56,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「信哥你動作還真快……我還沒聽完，你人就出發了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=6);",
    "links": [
      57
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 57,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「還磨什麼。我這人最受不了等了。這種事聽到重點，便足矣。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      58
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 58,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「好了，沒人叨擾了，我們喝吧。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      60
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 60,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（畫面淡出淡入。酒喝了將近一個時辰，罈子換了三回。你趴在桌上，呂信卻沒有半點要走的意思。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      61
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 61,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「唔呃……信哥，我們該走了吧……」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Nervous);",
    "links": [
      62
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 62,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「還早，再喝一會。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      63
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 63,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「可是……先不說我喝不下了，光是剛剛我們就遇到——」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);",
    "links": [
      64
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 64,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「六個乞丐、三個借錢周轉、四個賣身葬父。每一個……你眼都不眨就給錢。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=6);",
    "links": [
      65
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 65,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「你都沒聽到，旁邊客人都說你是散財義士了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=6);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      66
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 66,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「哈，這叫法還挺有意思的。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      67,
      70
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 67,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "「信哥，你這樣散，委託而來的報酬真的可以嗎？」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項1（機略）：記 LawChaos 負",
    "links": [
      68
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 70,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "「再散，明天你就是第七個。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項2（通達）：記 GoodEvil 負",
    "links": [
      71
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 68,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「信哥，你這一晚扔出去的，怕是把這趟差事的錢都散完了。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,-0.2);",
    "links": [
      681
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 681,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「[em7]碗停在半空[/em7]，夠什麼夠。三萬六。我這幾串錢，填得了嗎？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      682
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 682,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「……填不了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": [
      683
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 683,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「填不了的，就別跟我算。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      684
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 684,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「錢這東西，今日沒了，明日再賺就有。人沒了，明日拿什麼賺。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      685
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 685,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他把碗裡剩的一口灌下去，話題就到此為止了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      80
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 71,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「照這個散法，明天信哥自己就是第七個乞丐。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=5);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,-0.2);",
    "links": [
      72
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 72,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「哈哈哈！那也威風。天下第一的乞丐，還是天下第一。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      73
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 73,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他笑得很大聲，笑完又給門邊那個縮著的老丐扔了一串。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      80
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 80,
    "actorID": "role_ZhaiZhu",
    "text": "[panel=2]「哪個混帳是呂信！給老子滾出來！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      81
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 81,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（外頭來了大隊人馬，火把把窗紙照得通紅。客人一哄而散，掌櫃鑽進了櫃檯底下。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      82
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 82,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「怎麼回事？這些人是……」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Shock);",
    "links": [
      83
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 83,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「應該是剛殺的土匪同夥吧。聚集得還真慢，我去去就回。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      84
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 84,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你按著桌沿站起來。三罈酒還在你身上晃。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      85
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 85,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "[em2][酒量檢定][/em2]「信哥，我跟你去。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項：酒量檢定 難度10",
    "links": [
      86
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 86,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);SetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndRoll);Continue()@Message(EndRoll);BeginDiceRoll(Manual,AlcoholToleranceCheck,10);",
    "Description": "空對話擲骰節點：酒量檢定 難度10",
    "links": [
      87
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 87,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「三罈酒算什麼。外頭那些人，我也出。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": [
      88,
      110
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 88,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你深吸了一口氣，把那股上湧的熱勁壓回肚子裡。門外的火把還是晃的，但地是穩的。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,AlcoholTolerance,10);",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice() == true;",
    "links": [
      89
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 89,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（畫面淡出淡入，場景到客棧門外。呂信已經站在火把裡，回頭看見你跟出來。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      90
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 90,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「哈！三罈下肚還走得出來——好小子。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      91
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 91,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「有種。站過來。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC2,25);",
    "links": [
      92
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 92,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「呂信在此，有何指教啊。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      93
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 93,
    "actorID": "role_ZhaiZhu",
    "text": "[panel=2]「就是你？殺我清風寨兄弟，還在牆下留名，有種啊你。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      94
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 94,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「還行。要不這樣寫，怎麼叫你們一夥自投羅網呢。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      95
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 95,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你聽懂了那句話的意思——牆上那個名字，從一開始就不是留給死人看的。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      96
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 96,
    "actorID": "role_ZhaiZhu",
    "text": "[panel=2]「還敢囂張！今日我全寨百人已把這裡團團包圍，看你還能往哪逃！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      97
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 97,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「包圍我？說錯了吧，應該是——」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=2);",
    "links": [
      98
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 98,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「——我包圍了你們！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=2);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Anger_2);",
    "links": [
      99
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 99,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);BeginFight(Combat,78);SetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndFight);Continue()@Message(EndFight);",
    "Description": "戰鬥觸發節點：清風寨嘍囉（⚠ 場次 ID 待作者填，不可沿用其他場次數字）",
    "links": [
      100
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 100,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "Continue();",
    "Description": "戰鬥緩衝節點",
    "links": [
      101,
      105
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 101,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（畫面淡出淡入。街上橫七豎八，火把掉了一地，還在燒。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "Conditions": "IsPassFight() == true;",
    "links": [
      102
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 102,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「真無趣，這樣也配叫百人了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=3);",
    "links": [
      103
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 103,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「你看。話講一百遍，不如刀出一次。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      104
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 104,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他把刀往地上一甩，甩掉那層血，收了。整套動作沒有停頓。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      120
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 105,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你被人從側面撞開，撞在門框上。再抬頭時，呂信已經橫在你前面，把整條街擋住了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "Conditions": "IsPassFight() == false;",
    "links": [
      106
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 106,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「躲我身後。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=2);",
    "links": [
      107
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 107,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（畫面淡出淡入。等你站起來，街上已經沒有人站著了。他連刀都沒換手。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      108
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 108,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「看見沒有？拳頭夠大，話就不必說第二遍。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      109
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 109,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他說這話的時候是笑著的，笑得很痛快。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      120
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 110,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你站得太急，整間客棧朝右邊斜了一下。刀是拔出來了，就是不太確定拔的是哪一把。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      111
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 111,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「喂，站都站不穩，還跟什麼？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=4);",
    "links": [
      112
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 112,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「坐著。這點貨色，你信哥一個人夠。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      113
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 113,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他一把按你回長凳，自己跨出門去。你想跟，腳下一步都邁不出去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      114
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 114,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（門外有人罵他牆下留名。他應了一聲，接著是刀，不是話。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      115
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 115,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（很快沒聲了。他回來時連刀都沒換手。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      116
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 116,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「看見沒有？這種事，一個人就夠。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      117
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 117,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);Continue();",
    "Description": "空內容緩衝節點，關閉表情特效",
    "links": [
      120
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 120,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「信哥剛一直不走，莫非是為一勞永逸，免得這些賊寇追殺那父女？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);",
    "links": [
      121
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 121,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「簡單的事就是要一次解決到位。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      122
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 122,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「可是……現在有個急需解決的小問題。酒錢，你還夠嗎？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=13);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Nervous);",
    "links": [
      123
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 123,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「[em7]摸了摸腰間，那裡空空的[/em7]，這個嘛……要不一起打雜吧。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Nervous);",
    "links": [
      124
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 124,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（就這樣，你們一起在客棧後院刷了半宿的碗，償還超支的酒錢。掌櫃全程沒敢多說一句話。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      125
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 125,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（要說粗枝大葉，不是；要說思慮周密，也不對。對這個信哥，你實難給個定論。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      126
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 126,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（碗刷完的時候天快亮了。他一路哼著霸王的曲子回府，跑調，哼得很大聲。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": []
  }
]
